  "prefLabel": "Plc 1207.01 Purpose and Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1207.01 Purpose and Applicability.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to establish ethical and professional standards to maintain a high standard of integrity, skills, and practice in the profession of court reporting.\n\n(b) These rules shall be binding upon each individual who is licensed as a court reporter in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1200.html"
}
